(4626936, 667393, 89431, '<td valign="top">I like the "sunrise" affect, it also was smart b/c it took care of a pesky give-away background. I think you would have been better off with a differnt road though.</td>', 'I like the "sunrise" affect, it also was smart b/c it took care of a pesky give-away background. I think you would have been better off with a differnt road though.', '2008-04-09 12:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
