(4630884, 665918, 89219, '<td valign="top">A great interpretation of that pic on carlwarner.com.  I really like the silhouette and the lack of depth between the buildings.  I think this is an improvement on the original.</td>', 'A great interpretation of that pic on carlwarner.com.  I really like the silhouette and the lack of depth between the buildings.  I think this is an improvement on the original.', '2008-04-10 18:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
