(4631435, 667374, 45475, '<td valign="top">Ha! The first thing I did when this challenge was announced, was to go see the highest rated images for inspiration. I desperately wanted to do "Flight" by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27158" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jemison</a>, but just couldn''t put it together in my head. You''ve done a magnificent job putting your spin on it, right down to adding a couple of birds in the foreground! Hope to see this on the front page, good luck!</td>', 'Ha! The first thing I did when this challenge was announced, was to go see the highest rated images for inspiration. I desperately wanted to do "Flight" by  jemison, but just couldn''t put it together in my head. You''ve done a magnificent job putting your spin on it, right down to adding a couple of birds in the foreground! Hope to see this on the front page, good luck!', '2008-04-10 21:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631455, 666699, 45475, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhh... lovely. Marooned (well, maybe not exactly) on a deserted island with your sweetheart. Wonderful set up, this must have taken some effort!</td>', 'Ahhhhh... lovely. Marooned (well, maybe not exactly) on a deserted island with your sweetheart. Wonderful set up, this must have taken some effort!', '2008-04-10 21:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631764, 666033, 61971, '<td valign="top">very creative. I love the lighting</td>', 'very creative. I love the lighting', '2008-04-11 00:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631774, 665443, 61971, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel like this takes the overall concept of the challenge as I am seeing in other shots. I like the photo on the map. Aside from my opinion of the challenge, i feel that the lighting is a little dark.</td>', 'I don''t feel like this takes the overall concept of the challenge as I am seeing in other shots. I like the photo on the map. Aside from my opinion of the challenge, i feel that the lighting is a little dark.', '2008-04-11 00:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631784, 666119, 61971, '<td valign="top">this could be considered a take on the challenge. IMO it doesn''t fit the "Tap into your arts and crafts skills and construct your own landscape scene to serve as the subject for your entry." I do like the diagonal composition and contrast of the two sides though.</td>', 'this could be considered a take on the challenge. IMO it doesn''t fit the "Tap into your arts and crafts skills and construct your own landscape scene to serve as the subject for your entry." I do like the diagonal composition and contrast of the two sides though.', '2008-04-11 00:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631785, 667053, 61971, '<td valign="top">very cute.. i like the camera.</td>', 'very cute.. i like the camera.', '2008-04-11 00:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631792, 667306, 61971, '<td valign="top">Tap into your arts and crafts skills and construct your own landscape "scene" to serve as the subject for your entry.<br/> <br/>I feel that this is a different take on the challenge theme, but does not fit into the description of the challenge. JMO Creative idea though. I would prefer the lighting to be a little brighter though. It may have worked a little better if your angle was from the ground so to speak then the plants would look like little trees.</td>', 'Tap into your arts and crafts skills and construct your own landscape "scene" to serve as the subject for your entry. I feel that this is a different take on the challenge theme, but does not fit into the description of the challenge. JMO Creative idea though. I would prefer the lighting to be a little brighter though. It may have worked a little better if your angle was from the ground so to speak then the plants would look like little trees.', '2008-04-11 00:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631797, 665807, 61971, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! I love the detail of the lighting in the house and on the little trees. Very creative!</td>', 'Wonderful! I love the detail of the lighting in the house and on the little trees. Very creative!', '2008-04-11 00:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631799, 667066, 61971, '<td valign="top">Great black and white. I love the reflection.</td>', 'Great black and white. I love the reflection.', '2008-04-11 00:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631800, 667338, 61971, '<td valign="top">Good concept. I feel that the purple on the left takes away from the nice contrast lighting on the dunes.</td>', 'Good concept. I feel that the purple on the left takes away from the nice contrast lighting on the dunes.', '2008-04-11 00:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631802, 667115, 61971, '<td valign="top">Cute cityscape. I like how the light that reflects off of the one building make it look like a lit up building at night.</td>', 'Cute cityscape. I like how the light that reflects off of the one building make it look like a lit up building at night.', '2008-04-11 00:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631807, 667355, 61971, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Lots of stuff to look at though. I think it would be better fore me if you simplified it by taking out the elephant looking piece of rock on the right and maybe had a little deeper dof</td>', 'Very creative. Lots of stuff to look at though. I think it would be better fore me if you simplified it by taking out the elephant looking piece of rock on the right and maybe had a little deeper dof', '2008-04-11 00:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631811, 665918, 61971, '<td valign="top">love the color and reflection</td>', 'love the color and reflection', '2008-04-11 00:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631813, 666574, 61971, '<td valign="top">great job including the clouds. good concept and execution.</td>', 'great job including the clouds. good concept and execution.', '2008-04-11 00:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631822, 667400, 61971, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. I feel like it is half cheating though. The background makes it a stand out landscape, but it looks too real, as though its a picture behind there. Love the detail of your main subject.</td>', 'Awesome shot. I feel like it is half cheating though. The background makes it a stand out landscape, but it looks too real, as though its a picture behind there. Love the detail of your main subject.', '2008-04-11 00:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631827, 667048, 61971, '<td valign="top">cute.. must have made you feel like a kid again. :)</td>', 'cute.. must have made you feel like a kid again. :)', '2008-04-11 00:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631831, 667249, 61971, '<td valign="top">awesome concept and execution. love the lighting and the reflection.</td>', 'awesome concept and execution. love the lighting and the reflection.', '2008-04-11 00:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631931, 667168, 45475, '<td valign="top">Oh that''s so heartbreaking. What a terrible waste of sugar ;) Very funny entry, good luck!</td>', 'Oh that''s so heartbreaking. What a terrible waste of sugar ;) Very funny entry, good luck!', '2008-04-11 01:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631946, 665918, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great silhouettes. Fantastic work on the lighting and colours. Love the use of what looks to be real liquid for water :)</td>', 'Great silhouettes. Fantastic work on the lighting and colours. Love the use of what looks to be real liquid for water :)', '2008-04-11 01:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631952, 666398, 45475, '<td valign="top">Lovely use for a wonderful abstract. The light streaming over the birds was a nice touch. Great work :)</td>', 'Lovely use for a wonderful abstract. The light streaming over the birds was a nice touch. Great work :)', '2008-04-11 01:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632103, 665279, 85561, '<td valign="top">Well shot... the chalks in back give it a surrealist feel...</td>', 'Well shot... the chalks in back give it a surrealist feel...', '2008-04-11 02:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632129, 667299, 45475, '<td valign="top">Interesting inversion. Dark, almost Steampunk-ish if you''d added some cogs.</td>', 'Interesting inversion. Dark, almost Steampunk-ish if you''d added some cogs.', '2008-04-11 02:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632130, 667115, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great arrangement and use of different shaped materials.</td>', 'Great arrangement and use of different shaped materials.', '2008-04-11 02:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632132, 667377, 45475, '<td valign="top">Good leading lines through this! The dof may be just a touch too tight, but a clever entry all the same :)</td>', 'Good leading lines through this! The dof may be just a touch too tight, but a clever entry all the same :)', '2008-04-11 02:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632134, 666823, 45475, '<td valign="top">The tornado backdrop is a scream! Love it :)</td>', 'The tornado backdrop is a scream! Love it :)', '2008-04-11 02:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632135, 667359, 45475, '<td valign="top">Looks alien. Have no idea what I''m looking at, but it''s great.</td>', 'Looks alien. Have no idea what I''m looking at, but it''s great.', '2008-04-11 02:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632138, 666844, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wowzers.... I''d be very surprised if this didn''t ribbon. Absolutely fantastic scene. Good light, colour, dof and superb creativity (not to mention patience!) putting this together.</td>', 'Wowzers.... I''d be very surprised if this didn''t ribbon. Absolutely fantastic scene. Good light, colour, dof and superb creativity (not to mention patience!) putting this together.', '2008-04-11 02:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632139, 667277, 45475, '<td valign="top">Very unique spin on the cityscape idea. Well done :)</td>', 'Very unique spin on the cityscape idea. Well done :)', '2008-04-11 02:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632142, 667048, 45475, '<td valign="top">Cool. I fully expect to see Wallace and Gromit come strolling up the road.</td>', 'Cool. I fully expect to see Wallace and Gromit come strolling up the road.', '2008-04-11 02:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632143, 666137, 45475, '<td valign="top">Clever! The lighting could be better, but I love your idea :)</td>', 'Clever! The lighting could be better, but I love your idea :)', '2008-04-11 02:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632148, 667396, 45475, '<td valign="top">Nicely laid out. Good clean and crisp image and the pale colour works well.</td>', 'Nicely laid out. Good clean and crisp image and the pale colour works well.', '2008-04-11 02:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632155, 667356, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great scale, nice work!</td>', 'Great scale, nice work!', '2008-04-11 02:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
