(4634222, 665807, 30454, '<td valign="top">Nice Blue colors, and my pick for "Blue". Good luck. Almost looks like real landscape. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice Blue colors, and my pick for "Blue". Good luck. Almost looks like real landscape. Good luck.', '2008-04-11 23:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4634224, 666033, 30454, '<td valign="top">My pick for the ribbon. Very nice landscape with lots of creativity. I like the Brocolli tree and Flower sheep in particular. The reflection, the sand, the mountain, everything works for me. Good luck.</td>', 'My pick for the ribbon. Very nice landscape with lots of creativity. I like the Brocolli tree and Flower sheep in particular. The reflection, the sand, the mountain, everything works for me. Good luck.', '2008-04-11 23:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4634225, 667396, 30454, '<td valign="top">Best of the lot. My pick for the ribbon. Good luck.</td>', 'Best of the lot. My pick for the ribbon. Good luck.', '2008-04-11 23:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4634574, 667396, 20130, '<td valign="top">very nutty image  ...but they''ll probally screw you with their scores ;-)</td>', 'very nutty image  ...but they''ll probally screw you with their scores ;-)', '2008-04-12 03:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4634593, 666888, 68035, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept behind this shot.  Not quite sure whether it would have been better in colour (though I wonder if the colours did not go).  Given that you went B&amp;W I think it could have done with a little more contrast to give it some ''pop''</td>', 'I really like the concept behind this shot.  Not quite sure whether it would have been better in colour (though I wonder if the colours did not go).  Given that you went B&W I think it could have done with a little more contrast to give it some ''pop''', '2008-04-12 03:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4634603, 667306, 68035, '<td valign="top">Probably my favourite idea of the whole challenge.  It just made me gasp and smile when I saw this, very creative.<br/> <br/>good colours.  A couple of little points, it seems just a fraction off on the focus and I wonder whether turning the keyboard slight would have added an interesting angle rather than a straight on shot<br/> <br/>Let me tell you though I would take a shot like this over yet another pixel perfect ''smooth water'' ''northern lights'' or ''crown of water'' ever time<br/> <br/>Great creativity 9 from me</td>', 'Probably my favourite idea of the whole challenge.  It just made me gasp and smile when I saw this, very creative. good colours.  A couple of little points, it seems just a fraction off on the focus and I wonder whether turning the keyboard slight would have added an interesting angle rather than a straight on shot Let me tell you though I would take a shot like this over yet another pixel perfect ''smooth water'' ''northern lights'' or ''crown of water'' ever time Great creativity 9 from me', '2008-04-12 03:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4634606, 667396, 68035, '<td valign="top">Outstanding idea and wonderfully executed.  This truly meets the challenge in one of the fullest and best ways.  9 from me</td>', 'Outstanding idea and wonderfully executed.  This truly meets the challenge in one of the fullest and best ways.  9 from me', '2008-04-12 03:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4634608, 667249, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Terrific concept and delivery.  I dont know whether there is perhaps just a little too much ice berg, but that is a very minor issue, love the blue hued moonlight.  I think this will do very very for you</td>', 'Great shot.  Terrific concept and delivery.  I dont know whether there is perhaps just a little too much ice berg, but that is a very minor issue, love the blue hued moonlight.  I think this will do very very for you', '2008-04-12 03:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4634651, 666137, 68035, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly creative and wonderfully executed.  Meets the challenge in every respect.  9 from me and I think you are going to be in ribbon territory with this one</td>', 'Brilliantly creative and wonderfully executed.  Meets the challenge in every respect.  9 from me and I think you are going to be in ribbon territory with this one', '2008-04-12 04:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4634659, 667338, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea and nicely executed.  I am still wondering whether this is brown sugar or a very artfully placed blanket, but what ever it is it works well.  I love the subtlty of the curves that you have greated and the ''by moonlight'' adds another level.  Beautiful textures.  Bumped to 9</td>', 'Very creative idea and nicely executed.  I am still wondering whether this is brown sugar or a very artfully placed blanket, but what ever it is it works well.  I love the subtlty of the curves that you have greated and the ''by moonlight'' adds another level.  Beautiful textures.  Bumped to 9', '2008-04-12 04:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4634661, 667140, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well executed - I think if it had not been for river city in steel (which although I feel both pictures are as strong as each other possibly imo has one or two little additional touches) this would have ribboned.  Still deserving of a very high score and a great placing.  Terrific image and spot on in meeting the challenge</td>', 'Great idea and well executed - I think if it had not been for river city in steel (which although I feel both pictures are as strong as each other possibly imo has one or two little additional touches) this would have ribboned.  Still deserving of a very high score and a great placing.  Terrific image and spot on in meeting the challenge', '2008-04-12 04:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4634663, 666033, 68035, '<td valign="top">Has got several wonderful elements to it<br/> <br/>1.  Meets the challenge - Yes<br/>2.  Is original - Yes<br/>3.  Is technically strong - Yes<br/>4.  Has a wonderful sense of creativity - Yes<br/>5.  Is funny without letting the joke overpower the photo - Yes<br/> <br/>9 from me - Good luck</td>', 'Has got several wonderful elements to it 1.  Meets the challenge - Yes2.  Is original - Yes3.  Is technically strong - Yes4.  Has a wonderful sense of creativity - Yes5.  Is funny without letting the joke overpower the photo - Yes 9 from me - Good luck', '2008-04-12 04:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
