(4639108, 666664, 89219, '<td valign="top">either this is an astonishing piece of arts and craftsmanship or this is actually a courtyard and cats.  It doesn''t really look like any other sort of landscape than it actually is, therefore isn''t homemade.  I have to say DNMC and give a low score I''m afraid.<br/> <br/>Without the challenge in mind its not a bad picture, I like the lighting its pretty interesting as are the cats poses.</td>', 'either this is an astonishing piece of arts and craftsmanship or this is actually a courtyard and cats.  It doesn''t really look like any other sort of landscape than it actually is, therefore isn''t homemade.  I have to say DNMC and give a low score I''m afraid. Without the challenge in mind its not a bad picture, I like the lighting its pretty interesting as are the cats poses.', '2008-04-14 17:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
