(4641089, 666823, 63269, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a bit harsh, and also I wonder how the color version would work.... but the tilt is excellent!</td>', 'The lighting seems a bit harsh, and also I wonder how the color version would work.... but the tilt is excellent!', '2008-04-15 15:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
