(4641093, 666119, 45198, '<td valign="top">DNMC</td>', 'DNMC', '2008-04-15 15:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641094, 667271, 63269, '<td valign="top">I wish it were a little less grainy, and the saturation weren''t quite so high - but very nicely done! The lighting and the shadows it creates are fascinating.</td>', 'I wish it were a little less grainy, and the saturation weren''t quite so high - but very nicely done! The lighting and the shadows it creates are fascinating.', '2008-04-15 15:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641095, 665953, 45198, '<td valign="top">GREAT !! i really want to know how it was done.</td>', 'GREAT !! i really want to know how it was done.', '2008-04-15 15:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641097, 667408, 63269, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit harsh - I would definitely suggest shooting this at a different time of day, such as morning or evening, so that you didn''t have those distracting shadows. Good try though! :)</td>', 'The lighting is a bit harsh - I would definitely suggest shooting this at a different time of day, such as morning or evening, so that you didn''t have those distracting shadows. Good try though! :)', '2008-04-15 15:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641099, 667251, 63269, '<td valign="top">The colors and contrast looks a little off here. On my screen, there are very few white highlights in the image, instead they''re sort of a gray. This gives the image a sort of dull appearance. An adjustment in levels or contrast should help that. Also, maybe it''s just my screen, but the colors seem a little bit to yellowish. However the subject itself is excellent! I can tell you put lots of work into it! :)</td>', 'The colors and contrast looks a little off here. On my screen, there are very few white highlights in the image, instead they''re sort of a gray. This gives the image a sort of dull appearance. An adjustment in levels or contrast should help that. Also, maybe it''s just my screen, but the colors seem a little bit to yellowish. However the subject itself is excellent! I can tell you put lots of work into it! :)', '2008-04-15 15:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641101, 666664, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition isn''t very strong in my opinion, but the shadow play you have captured here is fascinating!</td>', 'The composition isn''t very strong in my opinion, but the shadow play you have captured here is fascinating!', '2008-04-15 15:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641103, 667048, 63269, '<td valign="top">I would suggest using a slightly different lighting set-up. The clouds have been given shadows in this image, which somehow makes it less believable. But otherwise, excellent work!</td>', 'I would suggest using a slightly different lighting set-up. The clouds have been given shadows in this image, which somehow makes it less believable. But otherwise, excellent work!', '2008-04-15 15:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641107, 666137, 63269, '<td valign="top">It looks a tiny bit dark on my screen - perhaps it needs some more contrast? I love the lettuce for the forests though. Wonderful! :)</td>', 'It looks a tiny bit dark on my screen - perhaps it needs some more contrast? I love the lettuce for the forests though. Wonderful! :)', '2008-04-15 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641109, 667355, 63269, '<td valign="top">Perhaps not the best of compositions in my opinion, but I love the little touch of flame. good work! :)</td>', 'Perhaps not the best of compositions in my opinion, but I love the little touch of flame. good work! :)', '2008-04-15 16:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641115, 667184, 63269, '<td valign="top">Here''s my two cents. :)<br/>First of all, the image is underexposed. I can understand that perhaps you wanted a low-key type atmosphere, and I really like them myselve, but I''m not sure it''s really working here. Also, I would suggest avoiding cropping off the reflection of the birds, and straightening out the "horizon" in the distance the background. This is an ecxellent concept though - good idea!</td>', 'Here''s my two cents. :)First of all, the image is underexposed. I can understand that perhaps you wanted a low-key type atmosphere, and I really like them myselve, but I''m not sure it''s really working here. Also, I would suggest avoiding cropping off the reflection of the birds, and straightening out the "horizon" in the distance the background. This is an ecxellent concept though - good idea!', '2008-04-15 16:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641116, 667222, 63269, '<td valign="top">The contrasts and colors are superb - great work.</td>', 'The contrasts and colors are superb - great work.', '2008-04-15 16:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641120, 667168, 63269, '<td valign="top">I wonder if it would give this an even better composition if you had created a few bigger hills? Just a thought. I like the stars in the "sky" there. Good photo.</td>', 'I wonder if it would give this an even better composition if you had created a few bigger hills? Just a thought. I like the stars in the "sky" there. Good photo.', '2008-04-15 16:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641121, 666731, 63269, '<td valign="top">SUPERB I love the lighting and the colors. It''s easy to picture this as being real. :)</td>', 'SUPERB I love the lighting and the colors. It''s easy to picture this as being real. :)', '2008-04-15 16:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641122, 666119, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is excellent - the composition is very interesting. I would suggest adding a bit more contrast, and then you''ll have a first rate image.</td>', 'This is excellent - the composition is very interesting. I would suggest adding a bit more contrast, and then you''ll have a first rate image.', '2008-04-15 16:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641124, 667393, 63269, '<td valign="top">The saturation, and contrast is a bit harsh here... but you certainly had the right idea here! I guess one of the biggest things that''s bothering me is the sort of greenish splotch of pixels in the center of the photo, and the spots surrounding the "sun." It could very possibly be just the screen I''m veiwing it on though. The landscape itself though is excellent. Good work.</td>', 'The saturation, and contrast is a bit harsh here... but you certainly had the right idea here! I guess one of the biggest things that''s bothering me is the sort of greenish splotch of pixels in the center of the photo, and the spots surrounding the "sun." It could very possibly be just the screen I''m veiwing it on though. The landscape itself though is excellent. Good work.', '2008-04-15 16:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641126, 665279, 63269, '<td valign="top">Interesting - I like how a dark shadow seems to be spilling in from the right side of the image. It gives the photo some nice tones. The lighting seems a little bit harsh, creating some shadows. But overall, this is pretty good. :)</td>', 'Interesting - I like how a dark shadow seems to be spilling in from the right side of the image. It gives the photo some nice tones. The lighting seems a little bit harsh, creating some shadows. But overall, this is pretty good. :)', '2008-04-15 16:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641128, 666485, 63269, '<td valign="top">This could perhaps use just a tiny bit more black in the image - I would suggest adjusting the levels. But the lighting here is SUPERB! Well done.</td>', 'This could perhaps use just a tiny bit more black in the image - I would suggest adjusting the levels. But the lighting here is SUPERB! Well done.', '2008-04-15 16:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641132, 667360, 63269, '<td valign="top">It took me a moment to figure this out, and that will probably mean your score getting bombed...This must have taken a lot of work though - fascinating!</td>', 'It took me a moment to figure this out, and that will probably mean your score getting bombed...This must have taken a lot of work though - fascinating!', '2008-04-15 16:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641133, 666398, 92577, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2008-04-15 16:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641141, 666033, 92577, '<td valign="top">if you''re English you were a fan of "Blue Peter"<br/>Nice enough to eat!</td>', 'if you''re English you were a fan of "Blue Peter"Nice enough to eat!', '2008-04-15 16:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641144, 665953, 92577, '<td valign="top">great idea and title</td>', 'great idea and title', '2008-04-15 16:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641157, 667215, 63269, '<td valign="top">I personally  don''t really care for the background... perhaps you intended for it to be look like a mountian, but it looks a little overexposed instead. or perhaps you intended for it to be just white, I''m not sure. In any case the rest of the image is also exposed. If you can fix that, that would help increase the impact of this image. Good try though! :)</td>', 'I personally  don''t really care for the background... perhaps you intended for it to be look like a mountian, but it looks a little overexposed instead. or perhaps you intended for it to be just white, I''m not sure. In any case the rest of the image is also exposed. If you can fix that, that would help increase the impact of this image. Good try though! :)', '2008-04-15 16:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641158, 667359, 92577, '<td valign="top">so near and yet so.... what is that thing-u-me-jig?</td>', 'so near and yet so.... what is that thing-u-me-jig?', '2008-04-15 16:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641160, 665918, 63269, '<td valign="top">Superb. Beautiful. I love the blue tones and the stark contrasts.</td>', 'Superb. Beautiful. I love the blue tones and the stark contrasts.', '2008-04-15 16:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641162, 665443, 63269, '<td valign="top">Perfectly exposed and focused.</td>', 'Perfectly exposed and focused.', '2008-04-15 16:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641164, 667140, 63269, '<td valign="top">I think this is my favorite of the screw and nail cities I''ve seen so far. I love the shallow DOF, and the silvery tones are just absolutely <i>lovely</i>. Awesome work.</td>', 'I think this is my favorite of the screw and nail cities I''ve seen so far. I love the shallow DOF, and the silvery tones are just absolutely lovely. Awesome work.', '2008-04-15 16:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641167, 667374, 92577, '<td valign="top">homage to a previous winner. the bird looks right in yours. I like it</td>', 'homage to a previous winner. the bird looks right in yours. I like it', '2008-04-15 16:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641176, 667306, 92577, '<td valign="top">with only a week you should have used ''miracle grow''<br/>I''m sure you''ll be taking more pics as this scene develops.<br/>great  idea</td>', 'with only a week you should have used ''miracle grow''I''m sure you''ll be taking more pics as this scene develops.great  idea', '2008-04-15 16:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641181, 667148, 63269, '<td valign="top">I might suggest not taking the picture from above - move the camera down for a more interesting angle. Also, the composition isn''t very strong in my opinion. Try moving some of the elements around until you get something that really catches the eye. Good try though! :)</td>', 'I might suggest not taking the picture from above - move the camera down for a more interesting angle. Also, the composition isn''t very strong in my opinion. Try moving some of the elements around until you get something that really catches the eye. Good try though! :)', '2008-04-15 16:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641182, 666974, 92577, '<td valign="top">cheeky</td>', 'cheeky', '2008-04-15 16:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641187, 666797, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, for the most part, I love it!My only complaint are the sticks in the way on the right of the photo. Not only do they get in the way of the subject, but they create some distracting shadows. I just thought though... perhaps you wanted to make it seem like you were peering through a bush to see the nest. In that case I would suggest putting more sticks around the edges, and readjusting the lighting (somehow!) in a way there weren''t any shadows from the sticks. But the bright colors are lovely. I just really like this. Well done! :)</td>', 'Well, for the most part, I love it!My only complaint are the sticks in the way on the right of the photo. Not only do they get in the way of the subject, but they create some distracting shadows. I just thought though... perhaps you wanted to make it seem like you were peering through a bush to see the nest. In that case I would suggest putting more sticks around the edges, and readjusting the lighting (somehow!) in a way there weren''t any shadows from the sticks. But the bright colors are lovely. I just really like this. Well done! :)', '2008-04-15 16:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641188, 667115, 63269, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I personally wonder how this might look with a less bold background...but overall this is pretty good.</td>', 'Interesting. I personally wonder how this might look with a less bold background...but overall this is pretty good.', '2008-04-15 16:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641190, 667168, 92577, '<td valign="top">bold</td>', 'bold', '2008-04-15 16:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641197, 666924, 63269, '<td valign="top">Eureka! I love it! What an incredible eye... That is just amazing! I hope the other voters "get it" too. Who would have thought of looking inside a popcorn bag?! :)</td>', 'Eureka! I love it! What an incredible eye... That is just amazing! I hope the other voters "get it" too. Who would have thought of looking inside a popcorn bag?! :)', '2008-04-15 16:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641198, 667081, 63269, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I care for the background, and the lighting is creating a few harsh shadows... but detail of every element here is fabulous. Great work!</td>', 'I''m not sure I care for the background, and the lighting is creating a few harsh shadows... but detail of every element here is fabulous. Great work!', '2008-04-15 16:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641200, 667338, 63269, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the image looks as though it''s lost some quality... but the photo itself is excellent - awesome lighting. ;)</td>', 'Unfortunately the image looks as though it''s lost some quality... but the photo itself is excellent - awesome lighting. ;)', '2008-04-15 16:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641203, 665433, 63269, '<td valign="top">Good colors and lighting.</td>', 'Good colors and lighting.', '2008-04-15 16:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641204, 665870, 63269, '<td valign="top">This has just a bit too much contrast for me, but it is very interesting...</td>', 'This has just a bit too much contrast for me, but it is very interesting...', '2008-04-15 16:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641205, 667167, 63269, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors, and interesting textures.</td>', 'Excellent colors, and interesting textures.', '2008-04-15 16:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641207, 666574, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I wonder how this might have looked with just a tad more color in the sky? just a thought.</td>', 'Very interesting. I wonder how this might have looked with just a tad more color in the sky? just a thought.', '2008-04-15 16:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641228, 666634, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, the little pink flowers are over-exposed, which really hurts the impact of the image. Also, I''m not sure what that thick, straight object to the right of the image is, and wonder if the photo might look better without it. Hope this helps! :)</td>', 'Well, the little pink flowers are over-exposed, which really hurts the impact of the image. Also, I''m not sure what that thick, straight object to the right of the image is, and wonder if the photo might look better without it. Hope this helps! :)', '2008-04-15 17:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641237, 666033, 63269, '<td valign="top">a superb setup, and perfect lighting, focus, composition, etc. well done.</td>', 'a superb setup, and perfect lighting, focus, composition, etc. well done.', '2008-04-15 17:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641245, 667306, 63269, '<td valign="top">A wonderfully clever idea! I wonder how this might look from a different, much closer angle. This might give the photo more interesting composition, and any shallow depth of field you could get would make it look even better. I like the concept though. :)</td>', 'A wonderfully clever idea! I wonder how this might look from a different, much closer angle. This might give the photo more interesting composition, and any shallow depth of field you could get would make it look even better. I like the concept though. :)', '2008-04-15 17:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641496, 665918, 48086, '<td valign="top">great take on the tried screw landscape. like the lighting and good use of background to highlight the silhouet, top 10 for sure.</td>', 'great take on the tried screw landscape. like the lighting and good use of background to highlight the silhouet, top 10 for sure.', '2008-04-15 20:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641562, 667359, 92464, '<td valign="top">woooooow ,  for the great colors &gt;&gt; 7</td>', 'woooooow ,  for the great colors >> 7', '2008-04-15 20:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
