(4641725, 667397, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it is, but it does look like a river at sundown. Very creative. That wide black border needs a motivational slogan.</td>', 'Not sure what it is, but it does look like a river at sundown. Very creative. That wide black border needs a motivational slogan.', '2008-04-15 22:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
